abstract: "Conservative recursive JSON consistency repair with exact constraint discovery, reversible minimal patches, provenance and authority gates, active falsification, proof replay, bounded-memory streaming, cross-document repair, persistent open obligations, distributed coherence checks, residual-information bounds, and fast/full execution modes."
